      "purpose": "`barcode` is a standards-driven Go library for validating, encoding, rendering, and decoding common one-dimensional and two-dimensional barcodes. Its core values are immutable logical modules; PNG, SVG, and `image.Image` output are derived views rather than the source of truth.",
